# Unsigned commits (this repo only)

This is a **personal** repo. The global git config signs with a **work**
x509/GPG key. That key must never touch these commits.

- Commits and tags here are **unsigned**.
- Use the repo-local config (`git config --local`), already `commit.gpgsign=false`
  and `tag.gpgsign=false`. If a commit fails with `gpg failed to sign`, set those
  two again **locally**. Do not pass `--no-gpg-sign` as the standing fix.
- Never `git config --global`. Never copy `user.signingkey` / `gpg.format=x509`
  into this repo.
- Do not `--no-verify`.
